# Pinned: this list is installed by a scheduled workflow (locked, with
# hashes, into requirements.txt), where an
# unpinned major release would arrive unannounced on a night nobody is
# watching. shapely is load-bearing - without it every geometric verdict
# silently becomes 'no_geometry' - so the build refuses to run when it is
# missing. See geometry.DistrictGeometry.usable().
